---
import SectionHead from "./SectionHead.astro";
import Unused from "./Unused.astro";
---

<section class="bloat" id="bloat" aria-labelledby="bloat-title">
  <SectionHead no="02" name="Bloat" />
  <div class="section-copy">
    <h2 id="bloat-title">Most of what loads is never used.</h2>
    <p>
      This run loaded 26 MCP tools and called 2. The skill list offers 12 skills, and 3 were used in a month. Every
      unused tool and skill still takes its place in context on every call.
    </p>
  </div>
  <Unused />
</section>
